              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Luka Manase da apotu ice kolunakinos mama ejai Daudi naabunio nepepe ka Ipilisitian asurokin Saul kojie, konye mam apotu kinarakis kes: naarai kinerut ijaka luka Ipilisitian, kotwarata ŋes, koba lasi ebe, “Epedori alunakin mama ejai ekapolonike Saul kosodi ayaun akaŋas akwesiwok.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naalosio ŋesi Sikilag, kolunakinos mamake luka Manase, Aduna, ka Yosabad, ka Yediael, ka Mikael, ka Yosabad, ka Eliku, ka Siletai, ikapolok luka ilukumin lukeraas luka Manase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.30.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 30:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kiŋarakis Daudi asurokin erioŋet loka ikaŋatak; naarai keraas kesi kere ituŋa lukirigin luetitin, koraas ikapolok luka ajore. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naarai ŋinipaaran kopotu ituŋa mama ejai Daudi aiŋarakin ŋes, aitodol nakeraunor ajore naepol, kwape ajore naka Edeke.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
